      "summary": "Revised r2 in response to Apollo CONCERNS. Architecture unchanged: better-sqlite3+FTS5, naudiodon2 mic in main, electron-audio-loopback renderer-bridged system audio, DB-First chunk handoff polled every 2s, AssemblyAI behind IASRProvider. r2 fixes: (1) §11.5 anchored with literature-cited Δ_DER prior (Bredin 2021, Park 2022, Coria 2021) — 2.5±1.5pp expected, 5pp gate; (2) §4.7.1 stitching algorithm specified to pseudocode (duration-weighted greedy 1:1, 1.5s window, deterministic tie-breaking, conservative new-label assignment); (3) §4.4 AssemblyAI client uses Buffer body + redirect:'manual' + sanitized error bodies; (4) §4.3 ChunkProcessor uses Promise.allSettled + per-chunk lastPolledAt + AbortSignal.timeout(10s); (5) §4.9.1 IPC error-classification table — renderer never sees raw error.message. ~58 new files, 6 modified."
